  "description": "BODHAF crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 63/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C87 H123 Dy7 N6 O33,6(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 15 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.634-5.170 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.47-178.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy7(OH)6(CO3)3(sach)3(sachH)3(MeOH)6]·6MeOH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
